**Runtime source (Android):** `JavaScriptContextHolder` → cast `jlong` to `jsi::Runtime*`.

**Gotcha:** Always call `AttachCurrentThread` before any JNI call from a background thread. Never call JNI from a real-time audio thread (JVM may GC).

